      "act": "CORE",
      "role_note": "framework compressed",
      "narration_text": "An AI risk register is a draft of the known risks -- you own the rest. Three steps. Score: let the AI rate the common risks, fast. Own: add the project-specific risk it can't see -- your team, your vendor, your timeline. Watch: give every real risk a trigger and an owner. A register nobody watches is just a list.",
